#: ../../integration_guides/supportedVersions/supportedVersions.rst:4
msgid ""
"Morpheus supports an extensive range of software integrations and versions "
"past and present. Current iterations of Amazon AWS, Microsoft Azure, Google "
"Cloud Platform, Digital Ocean, OpenTelekom Cloud, IBM Bluemix, Softlayer and"
" UpCloud are all supported."
msgstr ""
"Morpheus supports un extensive range of software integrations y versions "
"past y present. Current iterations of Amazon AWS, Microsoft Azure, Google "
"Cloud Platform, Digital Ocean, OpenTelekom Cloud, IBM Bluemix, Softlayer y "
"UpCloud son todos compatible."

